[
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:0.1"], "en": "Buddhavamsa 4.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:0.2"], "en": "The Lineage of Koṇḍañña Buddha:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:1.1"], "en": "\"After Dīpaṅkara...\"", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:1.2"], "en": "The leader named Koṇḍañña,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:1.3"], "en": "of infinite splendor and immeasurable fame,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:1.4"], "en": "is unfathomable and invincible.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:2.1"], "en": "In forbearance, he is like the earth;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:2.2"], "en": "in virtue, he is like the ocean;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:2.3"], "en": "in concentration, he is like Mount Meru.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:2.4"], "en": "Through wisdom, he is like the sky.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:3.1"], "en": "He is the illuminator of the faculties, powers,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:3.2"], "en": "factors of enlightenment, path, and truths.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:3.3", "PA_bv_4:3.4", "PA_bv_4:4.1"], "en": "The Buddha always proclaimed [this] for the welfare of all living beings while setting in motion the Wheel of Dhamma.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:4.2"], "en": "When Koṇḍañña was the Leader of the World,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:4.3", "PA_bv_4:4.4"], "en": "there occurred the first realization for one hundred thousand times ten million beings.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:5.1", "PA_bv_4:5.2"], "en": "Furthermore, while he was teaching in that assembly of humans and gods,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:5.3"], "en": "[there were] ninety thousand koṭis.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:5.4", "PA_bv_4:6.1", "PA_bv_4:6.2"], "en": "The second realization occurred when he taught the Dhamma, crushing the heretics.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:6.3", "PA_bv_4:6.4"], "en": "There was a third realization for eighty thousand koṭis;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:7.1"], "en": "there were three such assemblies.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:7.2"], "en": "Of Koṇḍañña, the Great Sage;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:7.3"], "en": "of those whose taints are destroyed, who are stainless,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:7.4"], "en": "whose minds are peaceful, and who are steadfast.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:8.1", "PA_bv_4:8.2"], "en": "The first assembly consisted of one hundred thousand times ten million;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:8.3"], "en": "the second was of one thousand times ten million.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:8.4"], "en": "The third [assembly] consisted of ninety koṭis.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:9.1"], "en": "At that time,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:9.2"], "en": "I was a khattiya named Vijitāvī.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:9.3", "PA_bv_4:9.4"], "en": "I exercised sovereignty over the ocean from end to end,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:10.1"], "en": "over hundreds of thousands of millions.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:10.2"], "en": "I satisfied the stainless Great Seers,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:10.3"], "en": "together with the Lord of the World,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:10.4"], "en": "with supreme food.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:11.1", "PA_bv_4:11.2"], "en": "That Buddha Koṇḍañña, the leader of the world, also prophesied of me:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:11.3"], "en": "\"In immeasurable aeons...\"", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:11.4"], "en": "A Buddha will arise in the world.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:12.1", "PA_bv_4:12.2"], "en": "Having exerted himself in striving and performed the practice of austerities;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:12.3", "PA_bv_4:12.4"], "en": "At the foot of an assattha tree, the Greatly Renowned One, the Perfectly Awakened One, will awaken.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:13.1"], "en": "His mother, his progenitrix—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:13.2"], "en": "Her name shall be Māyā;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:13.3"], "en": "her father, named Suddhodana,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:13.4"], "en": "shall be this Gotama.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:14.1", "PA_bv_4:14.2"], "en": "Kolita and Upatissa shall be the foremost disciples;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:14.3"], "en": "his attendant shall be named Ānanda.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:14.4"], "en": "I shall attend upon this Conqueror.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:15.1", "PA_bv_4:15.2"], "en": "Khemā and Uppalavaṇṇā shall be the foremost female disciples.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:15.3", "PA_bv_4:15.4"], "en": "The Bodhi tree of that Blessed One is called the Assattha;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:16.1"], "en": "and Citta of Hatthāḷavaka—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:16.2", "PA_bv_4:16.3"], "en": "Nandamātā and Uttarā shall be the foremost among those who provide service;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:16.4"], "en": "they shall be the chief attendants.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:16.5", "PA_bv_4:16.6"], "en": "“The lifespan of that illustrious Gotama will be one hundred years.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:17.1"], "en": "Having heard these words,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:17.2"], "en": "Of the peerless Great Sage,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:17.3"], "en": "humans and gods were filled with joy, thinking,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:17.4"], "en": "\"This one, it is said, is the seed of a Buddha.\"", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:18.1"], "en": "Shouts of acclamation arise;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:18.2"], "en": "they clap their hands and laugh;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:18.3"], "en": "with palms joined in reverence, they pay homage.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:18.4"], "en": "Ten thousand deities [thought]:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:19.1", "PA_bv_4:19.2"], "en": "\"If we should fail in the teaching of this Lord of the World;\"", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:19.3"], "en": "In the future time,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:19.4"], "en": "we shall stand face-to-face with this [teaching].", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:20.1"], "en": "Just as people crossing a river,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:20.2"], "en": "Having left the upper ford,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:20.3", "PA_bv_4:20.4"], "en": "they take hold at the lower ford and cross over the great river.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:21.1"], "en": "In the same way,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:21.2"], "en": "if we all were to release this Victor,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:21.3"], "en": "in a future time, [we too would become Victors].", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:21.4"], "en": "\"We shall be present before him.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:22.1"], "en": "Having heard his words,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:22.2"], "en": "my mind became even more serene.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:22.3"], "en": "Accomplishing that very purpose,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:22.4"], "en": "I gave a great kingdom to the Victor;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:22.5"], "en": "having given that great kingdom, I—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:22.6"], "en": "I went forth in his presence.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:23.1"], "en": "I mastered the Suttanta and the Vinaya—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:23.2"], "en": "the ninefold teaching of the Teacher.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:23.3"], "en": "Having mastered everything,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:23.4"], "en": "I brought glory to the Conqueror’s teaching.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:24.1"], "en": "Dwelling there with diligence, I—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:24.2"], "en": "In sitting, standing, and walking,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:24.3"], "en": "having reached perfection in direct knowledge,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:24.4"], "en": "I went to the world of Brahmā.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:25.1"], "en": "The city was named Rammavatī,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:25.2"], "en": "the kṣatriya was named Sunanda,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:25.3"], "en": "and the mother was named Sujātā.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:25.4"], "en": "Of Koṇḍañña, the Great Sage.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:26.1", "PA_bv_4:26.2"], "en": "For ten thousand years he dwelt within the household life.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:26.3"], "en": "Suci, Suruci, and Subha—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:26.4"], "en": "these were the three supreme palaces.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:27.1"], "en": "Three hundred thousand [were their attendants].", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:27.2"], "en": "The women were beautifully adorned;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:27.3", "PA_bv_4:27.4"], "en": "the woman named Queen Ruci was his daughter, Vijitasena.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:28.1"], "en": "Having seen four omens,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:28.2"], "en": "he went forth in a chariot;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:28.3"], "en": "for ten full months, he remained.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:28.4", "PA_bv_4:29.1"], "en": "The Conqueror applied himself to the supreme effort when he was entreated by Brahmā;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:29.2"], "en": "so did Koṇḍañña, the best of bipeds.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:29.3", "PA_bv_4:29.4"], "en": "The Great Hero set the wheel in motion among the gods in the supreme city.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:30.1"], "en": "Bhadda and Subhadda—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:30.2"], "en": "They were his chief disciples;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:30.3", "PA_bv_4:30.4"], "en": "the attendant of the great sage Koṇḍañña was named Anuruddha.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:31.1", "PA_bv_4:31.2"], "en": "Tissā and Upatissā were his two chief female disciples;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:31.3"], "en": "his Bodhi tree was the Salakalyāṇika.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:31.4"], "en": "Of Koṇḍañña, the Great Sage.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:32.1", "PA_bv_4:32.2"], "en": "Soṇa and Upasoṇa were his chief attendants.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:32.3", "PA_bv_4:32.4"], "en": "Nandā and Sirīmā were his chief attendants.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:33.1"], "en": "He stood eighty-eight cubits tall.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:33.2"], "en": "The Great Sage stands towering aloft;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:33.3", "PA_bv_4:33.4"], "en": "he shines like the lord of stars or like the sun at midday.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:34.1"], "en": "For a hundred thousand years,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:34.2"], "en": "his lifespan lasts for that long;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:34.3"], "en": "remaining for that duration, he—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:34.4"], "en": "He ferried across a vast multitude of people.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:35.1"], "en": "With those whose taints were exhausted and who were stainless,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:35.2"], "en": "the earth became variegated.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:35.3", "PA_bv_4:35.4"], "en": "Just as the sky is adorned by the stars, so did he shine;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:36.1"], "en": "those nāgas too were immeasurable.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:36.2"], "en": "Unshakeable and difficult to assail,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:36.3", "PA_bv_4:36.4"], "en": "they who possessed great glory have passed away like a flash of lightning.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:37.1"], "en": "And that incomparable psychic power of the Victor,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:37.2"], "en": "and the concentration perfumed by wisdom—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:37.3"], "en": "all that has vanished.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:37.4"], "en": "\"Are not all conditioned phenomena empty?", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_bv_4:38.1", "PA_bv_4:38.2"], "en": "The eminent Buddha Koṇḍañña has attained Nibbāna at Candārāma.\"", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
